{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3a262c66-e20a-8249-a2d0-a599bd03fc52",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:42:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nadia Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:39:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:39:26-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, Nadia Abdi. I'm calling about the street in front of my house, 203 Van Zandt Avenue, up in the North End. Every time we get a real storm it turns into a pond, and it's still sitting there three days after the nor'easter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:39:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still standing water, even now? Tuesday afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:39:47-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still standing. Friday into Saturday it came down hard, and I get it, that's a lot of rain. But it's Tuesday and the water hasn't gone anywhere. Cars come through and throw wakes like they're on the Bay. One of them nearly hit my mailbox with the spray. Hello? Sorry, hang on, I think I muted myself. [pause] Okay. Can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:40:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine now. You cut out for a second there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:40:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's twice I've muted my own phone this call. Sorry. Anyway, the drain at the corner just isn't taking anything. This isn't new, either. It does this every time and nobody's fixed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:40:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds really aggravating. Let me get this down. Two oh three Van Zandt, and the drain you mean is the one at the curb by your house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:40:40-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right at the curb, in front, and the one just down toward the corner. Both look packed with leaves and sand. I took a bunch of photos Saturday and again this morning. I can send them if you give me somewhere to send them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:40:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. I'll put in the request and note that you have photos. Can I get a callback number in case someone needs to follow up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:41:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:41:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0154. I'll flag this as standing water with possible blocked drains, so it goes to the drain crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:41:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do the crews work weekends? Because if it floods again before anyone shows up I'd rather know whether to expect somebody Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:41:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After a big storm they can be out on weekends, yes, but they're working through a long list right now. Realistically I'd say you could see someone in the next few days, depending on how the list shakes out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:41:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. Okay. I just want somebody to actually come look at it this time and clear the thing out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:41:49-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I've noted that you want a crew to physically inspect it. If the water starts to get close to your house or a car stalls out, call back right away and we'll bump it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:42:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks, Denise. I appreciate you taking it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:42:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Take care, Ms. Abdi."
    }
  ],
